      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "零一六",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "零一八",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 25.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "今天把各位都叫过来啊",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "主要咱讨论一下咱那个小区",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "如何把咱这小区的环境啊,包括居住安全啊,业主们提的一些意见啊,相对都给你们提了不少意见。",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "咱如何把咱这个小区建造得更美,住得更舒适,更安全。",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "这个话题咱讨论一下,各个负责人也跟一股辣打交道打了不少。",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 69.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "长时间打交道也累积了一些很宝贵的经验,看看物业提着这个需求,",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.0,
      "end": 78.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "如何把咱这个小区美化环境,居住安全,生活要水平,看看",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 78.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "如何提高一个档次,让咱小区在市场提高一个更好的档次。",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 95.5,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "两次,把这个物业水平也让业主团给咱一个更",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.5,
      "end": 104.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "高的平满水准,看看有没有这一块的辅入来。",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_00"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 110.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "那咱就那个啥办",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "咱是为了把咱们这个物业公司做得更好",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 114.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "是吧",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.0,
      "end": 115.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后的话",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 116.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "怎么去做得更好",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 118.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "还是说咱们得发现问题",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.0,
      "end": 120.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "也就是说咱们小区的这些业主",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.0,
      "end": 122.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "到底有哪些问题",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.0,
      "end": 124.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后的话我们",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.0,
      "end": 125.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "就是说针对",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.0,
      "end": 126.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "就是我们啊",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.0,
      "end": 128.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "发现了这些问题",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.0,
      "end": 129.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后我们做一个总结",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.0,
      "end": 131.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后就总结完以后",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.0,
      "end": 133.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "就是看我们怎么去更好地解决这些问题",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.0,
      "end": 134.12,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "解决这些问题",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.12,
      "end": 135.76,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "达到我们每一个业主",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.76,
      "end": 137.96,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后在这拘留一个满意度",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.96,
      "end": 140.16,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "这就是我觉得就是怎么去把我们工业",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.16,
      "end": 141.64,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "这一块做得更好",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.64,
      "end": 144.0,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "我这边搜集的几个问题就是啥来的",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.52,
      "end": 149.24,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "第一个就是说很多业主就反映啥来说",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 149.24,
      "end": 151.12,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "就是对外来这个车辆",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.12,
      "end": 153.04,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "进入咱们小区",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.04,
      "end": 155.12,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "监管力度不够",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.12,
      "end": 157.12,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "咱们就说一个问题一个问题来吧",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.12,
      "end": 157.44,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "是吧",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.44,
      "end": 159.56,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "一个问题一个问题去讨论",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.56,
      "end": 161.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "解决这个问题咱们讨论下个",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.32,
      "end": 163.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "解决问题 咱们讨论下层问题",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.32,
      "end": 165.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "第一个就是车辆误计",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.32,
      "end": 166.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "很多业主都不满意说",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.32,
      "end": 168.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "我的车为什么别的车在这停了",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 168.32,
      "end": 171.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后因为这个事还成了很多的纠纷",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 171.32,
      "end": 172.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "而我的车员在这儿",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 172.32,
      "end": 173.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "让你走你也不懂",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.32,
      "end": 174.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "打电话你也不来",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 174.32,
      "end": 176.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "所以这是确实有业主",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.32,
      "end": 178.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "给咱们物业啊",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 178.32,
      "end": 179.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "掏这个醋",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    },
    {
      "start": 179.32,
      "end": 180.32,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_01",
      "text": "然后提出这个业主",
      "speaker_original": "SPEAKER_01"
    }
  ],
